<title>NETHERLANDS: GIST-BROCADES ACQUIRES US DAIRY BUSINESS.</title>
<headline>GIST-BROCADES ACQUIRES US DAIRY BUSINESS.</headline>
<dateline>DELFT, Netherlands 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch biochemicals and food group Gist-Brocades NV said on Monday it had acquired dairy ingredients business from Cultor Food Science Inc in New York for $6.5 million.</p>
<p>The turnover of this business amounts to about $5 million, it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
